  "welcome": {
   "heading": "Welcome to Let's Make A Difference",
   "body": [
    "We are a community of young people inspired by the idea of Let’s Make A Difference. Lets Make A Difference challenges each individual to reflect deeply and ask a simple yet powerful question in silence: “What is truly right for me, and how can I bring that change into my life?” This inner inquiry is where the journey of transformation begins. Change starts with you when you reform yourself, you naturally influence and inspire thousands around you. This powerful idea has resonated with countless young people across India, bringing them together year after year in a shared journey of self-discovery, purpose, and positive change."
   ],
